{"fps": 30, "frames": 1663, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 144, "text": "The most famous market crash in history ruined almost nobody.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "most", "f": 8, "e": 11}, {"w": "famous", "f": 16, "e": 25}, {"w": "market", "f": 27, "e": 37}, {"w": "crash", "f": 39, "e": 46}, {"w": "in", "f": 48, "e": 50}, {"w": "history", "f": 53, "e": 66}, {"w": "ruined", "f": 75, "e": 87}, {"w": "almost", "f": 89, "e": 101}, {"w": "nobody.", "f": 105, "e": 133}]}, {"a": 144, "b": 297, "text": "Imagine you're in a smoky Haarlem tavern, winter, sixteen thirty-six.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 146, "e": 160}, {"w": "you're", "f": 161, "e": 165}, {"w": "in", "f": 166, "e": 167}, {"w": "a", "f": 169, "e": 171}, {"w": "smoky", "f": 174, "e": 185}, {"w": "Haarlem", "f": 187, "e": 199}, {"w": "tavern,", "f": 201, "e": 222}, {"w": "winter,", "f": 224, "e": 242}, {"w": "sixteen", "f": 246, "e": 256}, {"w": "thirty-six.", "f": 257, "e": 295}]}, {"a": 297, "b": 430, "text": "Men are bidding on tulips. Some bulbs fetch the price of a house.", "words": [{"w": "Men", "f": 299, "e": 304}, {"w": "are", "f": 306, "e": 311}, {"w": "bidding", "f": 312, "e": 320}, {"w": "on", "f": 321, "e": 322}, {"w": "tulips.", "f": 327, "e": 350}, {"w": "Some", "f": 357, "e": 361}, {"w": "bulbs", "f": 363, "e": 373}, {"w": "fetch", "f": 375, "e": 379}, {"w": "the", "f": 382, "e": 384}, {"w": "price", "f": 386, "e": 393}, {"w": "of", "f": 394, "e": 395}, {"w": "a", "f": 398, "e": 400}, {"w": "house.", "f": 402, "e": 423}]}, {"a": 430, "b": 581, "text": "Then, on February third, a Haarlem sale finds no buyers at all.", "words": [{"w": "Then,", "f": 432, "e": 448}, {"w": "on", "f": 450, "e": 453}, {"w": "February", "f": 455, "e": 469}, {"w": "third,", "f": 473, "e": 489}, {"w": "a", "f": 491, "e": 494}, {"w": "Haarlem", "f": 496, "e": 505}, {"w": "sale", "f": 507, "e": 517}, {"w": "finds", "f": 519, "e": 528}, {"w": "no", "f": 533, "e": 537}, {"w": "buyers", "f": 539, "e": 549}, {"w": "at", "f": 551, "e": 553}, {"w": "all.", "f": 555, "e": 578}]}, {"a": 581, "b": 670, "text": "Within days, the tulip market is dead.", "words": [{"w": "Within", "f": 583, "e": 587}, {"w": "days,", "f": 590, "e": 608}, {"w": "the", "f": 610, "e": 613}, {"w": "tulip", "f": 614, "e": 622}, {"w": "market", "f": 624, "e": 635}, {"w": "is", "f": 638, "e": 645}, {"w": "dead.", "f": 649, "e": 670}]}, {"a": 670, "b": 766, "text": "Books later wrote of merchants reduced to beggary.", "words": [{"w": "Books", "f": 672, "e": 681}, {"w": "later", "f": 683, "e": 690}, {"w": "wrote", "f": 693, "e": 697}, {"w": "of", "f": 699, "e": 702}, {"w": "merchants", "f": 704, "e": 718}, {"w": "reduced", "f": 721, "e": 731}, {"w": "to", "f": 734, "e": 738}, {"w": "beggary.", "f": 739, "e": 766}]}, {"a": 766, "b": 887, "text": "Legend says a sailor even ate a priceless bulb like an onion.", "words": [{"w": "Legend", "f": 768, "e": 777}, {"w": "says", "f": 779, "e": 786}, {"w": "a", "f": 789, "e": 793}, {"w": "sailor", "f": 795, "e": 807}, {"w": "even", "f": 811, "e": 816}, {"w": "ate", "f": 818, "e": 823}, {"w": "a", "f": 824, "e": 825}, {"w": "priceless", "f": 827, "e": 841}, {"w": "bulb", "f": 843, "e": 850}, {"w": "like", "f": 853, "e": 855}, {"w": "an", "f": 857, "e": 859}, {"w": "onion.", "f": 862, "e": 887}]}, {"a": 887, "b": 1044, "text": "But a historian who searched the Dutch archives could barely find a single bankruptcy.", "words": [{"w": "But", "f": 889, "e": 891}, {"w": "a", "f": 893, "e": 894}, {"w": "historian", "f": 899, "e": 912}, {"w": "who", "f": 915, "e": 919}, {"w": "searched", "f": 922, "e": 928}, {"w": "the", "f": 930, "e": 933}, {"w": "Dutch", "f": 935, "e": 939}, {"w": "archives", "f": 942, "e": 958}, {"w": "could", "f": 960, "e": 967}, {"w": "barely", "f": 970, "e": 978}, {"w": "find", "f": 982, "e": 985}, {"w": "a", "f": 987, "e": 994}, {"w": "single", "f": 999, "e": 1003}, {"w": "bankruptcy.", "f": 1006, "e": 1040}]}, {"a": 1044, "b": 1107, "text": "So where did all that money go?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 1046, "e": 1051}, {"w": "where", "f": 1054, "e": 1056}, {"w": "did", "f": 1058, "e": 1061}, {"w": "all", "f": 1063, "e": 1065}, {"w": "that", "f": 1067, "e": 1070}, {"w": "money", "f": 1072, "e": 1079}, {"w": "go?", "f": 1083, "e": 1106}]}, {"a": 1107, "b": 1173, "text": "You see, it was a preorder.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1109, "e": 1111}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1114, "e": 1127}, {"w": "it", "f": 1129, "e": 1131}, {"w": "was", "f": 1134, "e": 1136}, {"w": "a", "f": 1138, "e": 1141}, {"w": "preorder.", "f": 1143, "e": 1173}]}, {"a": 1173, "b": 1333, "text": "The bulbs were still underground, not delivered or paid for until they bloomed in June.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1175, "e": 1177}, {"w": "bulbs", "f": 1181, "e": 1189}, {"w": "were", "f": 1192, "e": 1195}, {"w": "still", "f": 1199, "e": 1202}, {"w": "underground,", "f": 1205, "e": 1230}, {"w": "not", "f": 1232, "e": 1237}, {"w": "delivered", "f": 1239, "e": 1250}, {"w": "or", "f": 1253, "e": 1257}, {"w": "paid", "f": 1259, "e": 1266}, {"w": "for", "f": 1269, "e": 1275}, {"w": "until", "f": 1278, "e": 1285}, {"w": "they", "f": 1288, "e": 1291}, {"w": "bloomed", "f": 1293, "e": 1303}, {"w": "in", "f": 1305, "e": 1307}, {"w": "June.", "f": 1310, "e": 1333}]}, {"a": 1333, "b": 1459, "text": "So the taverns traded promises. No bulbs, no cash.", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 1335, "e": 1337}, {"w": "the", "f": 1338, "e": 1339}, {"w": "taverns", "f": 1342, "e": 1358}, {"w": "traded", "f": 1360, "e": 1369}, {"w": "promises.", "f": 1373, "e": 1399}, {"w": "No", "f": 1401, "e": 1403}, {"w": "bulbs,", "f": 1406, "e": 1426}, {"w": "no", "f": 1429, "e": 1431}, {"w": "cash.", "f": 1433, "e": 1458}]}, {"a": 1459, "b": 1564, "text": "When prices collapsed, most buyers just never paid.", "words": [{"w": "When", "f": 1461, "e": 1463}, {"w": "prices", "f": 1465, "e": 1477}, {"w": "collapsed,", "f": 1485, "e": 1499}, {"w": "most", "f": 1502, "e": 1506}, {"w": "buyers", "f": 1509, "e": 1520}, {"w": "just", "f": 1522, "e": 1531}, {"w": "never", "f": 1534, "e": 1541}, {"w": "paid.", "f": 1546, "e": 1563}]}, {"a": 1564, "b": 1663, "text": "It's hard to lose a fortune that never left your pocket.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "f": 1566, "e": 1570}, {"w": "hard", "f": 1573, "e": 1575}, {"w": "to", "f": 1577, "e": 1579}, {"w": "lose", "f": 1582, "e": 1584}, {"w": "a", "f": 1586, "e": 1589}, {"w": "fortune", "f": 1595, "e": 1602}, {"w": "that", "f": 1606, "e": 1609}, {"w": "never", "f": 1613, "e": 1616}, {"w": "left", "f": 1619, "e": 1623}, {"w": "your", "f": 1625, "e": 1627}, {"w": "pocket.", "f": 1629, "e": 1646}]}]}